# Desktop shell configuration. Values packaged with Electron must be
# assumed readable by end users. NEVER put DB credentials, OAuth secrets,
# or ingest API keys here — those live on the server only.
#
# Packaged desktop apps are standalone local apps: with nothing set they run
# the bundled server and database (app://tracker). DESKTOP_APP_URL is only a
# runtime override read from the user's environment at launch; it is never
# baked into a build. If set, it must be an https:// URL.
# DESKTOP_APP_URL=https://your-hosted-instance.example
